  "notes": "OTP (One-Time Password) component for inputting verification codes. It's usually 4 to 6 digits long and is used for two-factor authentication (2FA) or passwordless login.\n\nNeeds daisyUI installed (npm i -D daisyui, then @plugin \"daisyui\" in your CSS).\n\nOriginal file: https://github.com/saadeghi/daisyui/blob/master/packages/docs/src/routes/(routes)/components/otp/+page.md",
  "code": "<label class=\"otp otp-neutral\">\n  <span></span>\n  <span></span>\n  <span></span>\n  <span></span>\n  <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"one-time-code\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" pattern=\"[0-9]{4}\" required />\n</label>\n\n<label class=\"otp otp-primary\">\n  <span></span>\n  <span></span>\n  <span></span>\n  <span></span>\n  <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"one-time-code\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" pattern=\"[0-9]{4}\" required />\n</label>\n\n<label class=\"otp otp-secondary\">\n  <span></span>\n  <span></span>\n  <span></span>\n  <span></span>\n  <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"one-time-code\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" pattern=\"[0-9]{4}\" required />\n</label>\n\n<label class=\"otp otp-accent\">\n  <span></span>\n  <span></span>\n  <span></span>\n  <span></span>\n  <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"one-time-code\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" pattern=\"[0-9]{4}\" required />\n</label>\n\n<label class=\"otp otp-info\">\n  <span></span>\n  <span></span>\n  <span></span>\n  <span></span>\n  <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"one-time-code\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" pattern=\"[0-9]{4}\" required />\n</label>\n\n<label class=\"otp otp-success\">\n  <span></span>\n  <span></span>\n  <span></span>\n  <span></span>\n  <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"one-time-code\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" pattern=\"[0-9]{4}\" required />\n</label>\n\n<label class=\"otp otp-warning\">\n  <span></span>\n  <span></span>\n  <span></span>\n  <span></span>\n  <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"one-time-code\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" pattern=\"[0-9]{4}\" required />\n</label>\n\n<label class=\"otp otp-error\">\n  <span></span>\n  <span></span>\n  <span></span>\n  <span></span>\n  <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"one-time-code\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"4\" pattern=\"[0-9]{4}\" required />\n</label>",
